WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.701
(gentle music)
- Some cheese, miss?

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.109
- Yes, please, thank you.
- Great.

00:00:03.109 --> 00:00:04.840
Just tell me when to stop.
- Yeah.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:09.007
(playful music increases in intensity)

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.131
- I'll tell you when I want you to stop.

00:00:22.131 --> 00:00:25.048
- Okay.
(fun music)

00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:32.011
- It's you.

00:00:32.011 --> 00:00:33.538
- Ooh, you guys want pizza for lunch?

00:00:33.538 --> 00:00:34.469
- Yes.
- Okay.

00:00:34.469 --> 00:00:36.229
- Oh, I can't have pizza;
I'm lactose intolerant.

00:00:36.229 --> 00:00:37.280
(cries out in alarm)

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.320
- (groans) That smells awful.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.487
- Yeah, that's how you know it's good.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:47.291
- You really put cheese
on everything, don't you?

00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:51.458
- Yeah.
(dramatic classical music)

00:00:53.564 --> 00:00:57.284
- Is that cheese on cheese?
(fun music)

00:00:57.284 --> 00:00:58.282
- Can I add cheese to that?

00:00:58.282 --> 00:00:59.364
Can I add cheese to that?

00:00:59.364 --> 00:01:00.593
- [Man] And would you
like cheese with that?

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.684
- (laughs) Jake, you crazy boy.

00:01:02.684 --> 00:01:05.153
Do I want cheese with that, you crazy.

00:01:05.153 --> 00:01:06.610
See you at pick up!

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:08.472
- I think I'm gonna name
my first daughter Brie.

00:01:08.472 --> 00:01:10.012
- You think I can name my kid Manchego?

00:01:10.012 --> 00:01:10.903
- Yes.
- Yeah.

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:12.171
- Yeah.
- That's a cool name.

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:13.703
- Can I get you anything?

00:01:13.703 --> 00:01:16.913
- What kind of cheese do you have?

00:01:16.913 --> 00:01:20.476
- So, Miss Brunson, you
are in excellent health.

00:01:20.476 --> 00:01:22.796
- Oh, thank goodness.
- Oh, and we also found

00:01:22.796 --> 00:01:24.984
the source of your stomach issues.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.084
- Okay, what is it?

00:01:26.084 --> 00:01:27.476
- Did you know you were
lactose intolerant?

00:01:27.476 --> 00:01:29.945
(dramatic music)

00:01:29.945 --> 00:01:33.476
Your blood has a deficiency in lactase--

00:01:33.476 --> 00:01:35.196
- No.
- Which is the enzyme--

00:01:35.196 --> 00:01:36.905
- No, no, no, no, no.
- That allows you

00:01:36.905 --> 00:01:38.804
to digest dairy.
- No!

00:01:38.804 --> 00:01:42.455
No, no, no!

00:01:42.455 --> 00:01:46.084
Cheese, cheese, cheese,
cheese, where's the cheese?

00:01:46.084 --> 00:01:48.251
(screams)

00:01:50.341 --> 00:01:52.753
(gasping)

00:01:52.753 --> 00:01:56.920
- What is it, Quinta?
- I just had the worst dream.

00:01:58.433 --> 00:02:02.055
It started off so relatable.
(fun music)

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:03.735
- What is this?
- Cheese.

00:02:03.735 --> 00:02:05.046
- What?
- You said you wanted cheese.

00:02:05.046 --> 00:02:06.875
- The fuck is this?
- You said you wanted cheese!

00:02:06.875 --> 00:02:08.134
- Kraft singles?

00:02:08.134 --> 00:02:10.504
What do you think I am, 12 years old?

00:02:10.504 --> 00:02:11.736
Are you kidding me?
- It's cheese!

00:02:11.736 --> 00:02:14.382
- How dare you disgrace me
with the cheese of a peasant?

00:02:14.382 --> 00:02:16.965
Get out, get out!

00:02:18.428 --> 00:02:20.164
This is not my apartment.

